      <div class="preloader-content-details">
        <h2>Mr. Morale,</h2>
        <p>
          <span>your </span>
          <span>Wrapped </span>
          <span>has </span>
          <span>arrived</span>
        </p>
        <button>JUMP IN</button>
      </div>
      <div class="preloader-content-footer">
        <a href="http://" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Legal</a>
